pbwinput 1
# Phase 3's exit route (PLAN.md section 7; oracle.py sequence aspertia; port/tools/oracle/README.md, "The comparison
# sequences"): New Game from power-on with a blank save into Aspertia City, where the player walks, talks to a
# townsperson, goes into a house and comes out again, changing maps each time. The title as the title sequence presses
# it (title_w2_us.pbwinput), then NEW GAME, the start menu's first item without a save, and the intro (overlay 294)
# with A twice a second: Professor Juniper's talk, Minccino out of its Poke Ball, the player AAAAAAA and the rival
# HughAAA, the season's name and the flight over Aspertia City into the field in front of the player's house, and its
# first scripts there and in the house, to the player's room. Then the story's first steps as starter_save's file takes
# them after CONTINUE, 8,650 game frames later here: down to Mom's scene and out of the door into Aspertia City (zone
# 427). Then west along z = 762, short of Hugh's scene's trigger on z = 761, to the man at (39,764) (npc 4 of
# res/field/events/aspertia_city.json, Script_13 of res/field/scripts/aspertia_city.s), A through his three lines, into
# the house at (38,761) (zone 431) and three tiles up, back out of its door, and east along z = 762. Positions are zone
# (x, z) tiles, counts GFL's frame count (sVBlankCount), as the oracle shows them. The clock is pinned, as in
# field_menus, so that both programs keep the same time of day. On game frames, so that each press reaches both
# programs on the same pass of the game's main loop. White 2.
version w2_us
clock pinned
# START in the opening skips it to the title (count 1115 on both)
1100 START
1101 -
# START brings back the layers the title hid at count 2877
3000 START
3001 -
# START leaves for the start menu, which shows from count 3249
3100 START
3101 -
# NEW GAME, the start menu's first item without a save: Professor Juniper from count 3459
3400 A
3401 -
# A twice a second through the intro and the first scripts: Minccino's Poke Ball bursts open at count 3955,
# the player's name entry from 5624, the season's name from 7811, the flight over Aspertia City, and the
# field in front of the player's house from 9841 at (47,762), "Oh, hi!"; into the house (zone 428) from 11648,
# to the player's room at (14,3). The presses after the scripts end find nothing to read
